mdnsd
------------------------------------------
Embeddable Multicast DNS Daemon

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libmdnsd-devel-1.2-1bl1
  libmdnsd2-1.2-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libcmocka-devel-2.0.2-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/troglobit/mdnsd

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/troglobit/mdnsd/archive/refs/tags/v1.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack mdnsd-1.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./mdnsd-1.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/mdnsd-1.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/mdnsd-1.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmdnsd2-1.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmdnsd-devel-1.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(mdnsd)
  /etc/mdns.d/ssh.service
  /usr/bin/mquery.exe
  /usr/sbin/mdnsd.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/mdnsd.README
  /usr/share/doc/mdnsd/ChangeLog.md
  /usr/share/doc/mdnsd/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/mdnsd/README.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/mquery.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man5/mdnsd.service.5.gz
  /usr/share/man/man8/mdnsd.8.gz

(libmdnsd2)
  /usr/bin/cygmdnsd-2.dll

(libmdnsd-devel)
  /usr/include/libmdnsd/1035.h
  /usr/include/libmdnsd/inet.h
  /usr/include/libmdnsd/mdnsd.h
  /usr/include/libmdnsd/sdtxt.h
  /usr/include/libmdnsd/xht.h
  /usr/lib/libmdnsd.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/mdnsd.pc

